# Title: Wildfire Evacuation Chain
# Summary: A paper-oriented wildfire benchmark where each zone makes a local evacuation decision before the threat propagates to the next zone.
# Benchmark Family: wildfire_evacuation_chain
# Evacuation_1: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 1.
# Evacuation_10: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 10.
# Evacuation_2: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 2.
# Evacuation_3: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 3.
# Evacuation_4: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 4.
# Evacuation_5: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 5.
# Evacuation_6: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 6.
# Evacuation_7: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 7.
# Evacuation_8: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 8.
# Evacuation_9: Evacuation orders are issued in zone 9.
# Patrol_1: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 1.
# Patrol_10: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 10.
# Patrol_2: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 2.
# Patrol_3: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 3.
# Patrol_4: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 4.
# Patrol_5: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 5.
# Patrol_6: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 6.
# Patrol_7: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 7.
# Patrol_8: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 8.
# Patrol_9: Patrol coordination is activated in zone 9.
# Shelter_1: Shelter activation begins in zone 1.
# Shelter_10: Shelter activation begins in zone 10.
# Shelter_2: Shelter activation begins in zone 2.
# Shelter_3: Shelter activation begins in zone 3.
# Shelter_4: Shelter activation begins in zone 4.
# Shelter_5: Shelter activation begins in zone 5.
# Shelter_6: Shelter activation begins in zone 6.
# Shelter_7: Shelter activation begins in zone 7.
# Shelter_8: Shelter activation begins in zone 8.
# Shelter_9: Shelter activation begins in zone 9.
# Smoke_1: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 1.
# Smoke_10: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 10.
# Smoke_2: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 2.
# Smoke_3: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 3.
# Smoke_4: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 4.
# Smoke_5: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 5.
# Smoke_6: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 6.
# Smoke_7: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 7.
# Smoke_8: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 8.
# Smoke_9: Smoke is detected in wildfire response zone 9.

